<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <meta name="description" content="Alex Raskin — DevOps engineer. Infrastructure, Kubernetes, Go, Nix.">
  <title>Alex Raskin</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <main>
      <h2>Hello! I'm Alex 👋</h2>

      <p>Self taught DevOps Engineer. Infrastructure, Cats and Franzbrötchen.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Most of what I build ends up being <span class="go">Go</span>,
          <span class="terraform">Terraform</span>, or both.</li>
        <li>My homelab is a highly available <span class="k8s">Kubernetes cluster</span> on Talos Linux</li>
        <li>I daily drive a 2026 macbook air, managed with nix-darwin.</li>
        <li>Long time experience with Linux, open source, and self-hosting.</li>
        <li><span class="go">Go</span>,
          <span class="terraform">Terraform</span>,
          <span class="nix">Nix</span>, TypeScript,
          <span class="bash">Bash</span>.</li>
      </ul>

      <p><a href="https://github.com/alexraskin">GitHub</a> ·
      <a href="https://twitter.com/notalexraskin">Twitter</a></p>

      <p>Email me at <span class="email" id="email"><noscript>hi [at] alexraskin [dot] com</noscript></span></p>

      {{ with .Track }}
        <p class="muted">
          {{ if .NowPlaying }}Currently listening to{{ else }}Last listened to{{ end }}
          <a href="{{ .URL }}">{{ .Name }}</a> by
          <a href="{{ .ArtistURL }}">{{ .Artist }}</a>.
        </p>
      {{ end }}
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="/assets/js/email.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
